MACRO PREF                                                                      
  &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND                                     W   181 A             
*                                 PARAMETRAR TILL WISOLAND FÖR                  
*                                 ATT KONVERTERA MELLAN 2- OCH                  
*                                 3-STÄLLIG KOD.                                
*                                                                               
*                                 EXEMPEL PÅ ANROP:                             
*                                 MOVE "AFG" TO LAND-IDLANDX3                   
*                                 MOVE "  "  TO LAND-IDLANDX2                   
*                                 ELLER                                         
*                                 MOVE "   " TO LAND-IDLANDX3                   
*                                 MOVE "AF"  TO LAND-IDLANDX2                   
*                                 CALL WISOLAND USING                           
*                                      LAND-WISOLAND                            
*                                                                               
*                                 RESULTAT ERHÅLLS I ÖVRIGA FÄLT                
*                                 STATUSKOD I LAND-KDSVAR.                      
*                                 BLANK = RÄTT, F = FEL                         
*                                 -------------------------------               
*                                 PARAMETERS TO WISOLAND FOR                    
*                                 CONVERTERING OF 2- OR                         
*                                 3-LETTERS COUNTRY CODE                        
*                                 EXAMPLE OF CALL:                              
*                                 MOVE "AFG" TO LAND-IDLANDX3                   
*                                 MOVE "  "  TO LAND-IDLANDX2                   
*                                 OR                                            
*                                 MOVE "   " TO LAND-IDLANDX3                   
*                                 MOVE "AF"  TO LAND-IDLANDX2                   
*                                 CALL WISOLAND USING                           
*                                      LAND-WISOLAND                            
*                                                                               
*                                 RESULT IS PLACED IN                           
*                                 REMAINDING FEILD                              
*                                 RETURN CODE IN LAND-KDSVAR.                   
*                                 BLANK = OK, F = ERROR                         
*                                 -------------------------------               
    &PREF.LAND-IDLANDX3 &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND                     3 A             
*                                 3-STÄLLIG LANDSBETECKNINGSKOD                 
*                                 3-LETTER CODE FOR COUNTRY.                    
    &PREF.LAND-IDLANDX2 &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND              +3     2 A             
*                                 2-STÄLLIG LANDSBETECKNINGSKOD                 
*                                 2-LETTER CODE FOR COUNTRY                     
    &PREF.LAND-BELAND-SVE &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND            +5    35 A             
*                                 SVENSK LANDSBETECKNING                        
*                                 SWEDISH NAME OF COUNTRY                       
    &PREF.LAND-BELAND-ENG &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND           +40    35 A             
*                                 ENGELSK LANDSBETECKNING                       
*                                 ENGLISH NAME OF COUNTRY                       
    &PREF.LAND-WISOVAL &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND              +75    35 A    +        
                   OCCURS     3                                                 
      &PREF.LAND-KDVALISO &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND           +75     3 A             
*                                 VALUTAKOD ENLIGT ISO-STANDARD.                
*                                 CURRENCY CODE BY ISO-STANDARD.                
      &PREF.FILLER01 &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND                +78     7 A             
      &PREF.LAND-BEVALISO &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND           +85    25 A             
*                                 BENÄMNING VALUTA ISO-STANDARD.                
*                                 DESCRIPTION CURRENCY BY ISO                   
    &PREF.LAND-KDSVAR &PREF.LAND-WISOLAND              +180     1 A             
*                                 SVAR FRÅN PROGRAM ELLER SKÄRM                 
*                                 RETURN CODE FROM PROGRAM                      
*** END COPY WISOLAND                LENGTH =           181                     
